1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,214
Good morning, oh sorry, it's gone 12, I'll start again, good afternoon, Kingswell Sports

2
00:00:08,214 --> 00:00:09,600
Club, how can I help you?

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,029
Oh, good afternoon.

4
00:00:11,029 --> 00:00:15,800
I was wondering if you could give me some information about membership and facilities.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,412
Of course.

6
00:00:16,412 --> 00:00:18,250
What would you like to know?

7
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:20,800
Do you have tennis courts, for example?

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,135
No, I'm afraid we don't.

9
00:00:23,135 --> 00:00:25,470
We're primarily a golf club.

10
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:26,610
What about football?

11
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:28,890
I heard you had a team.

12
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,564
No, I'm sorry.

13
00:00:30,564 --> 00:00:34,470
Perhaps you're thinking about Fresham Sports Centre.

14
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,463
Oh, right.

15
00:00:35,463 --> 00:00:36,953
I know it.

16
00:00:36,953 --> 00:00:38,940
I've played badminton there.

17
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:39,650
Have you?

18
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:43,910
They've got a lot of facilities we don't have and vice versa.

19
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:46,040
We do have a keep-fit studio,

20
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:48,170
which is very popular with members,

21
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:51,720
and then as well as that there's swimming, of course.

22
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:52,345
That's good.

23
00:00:52,345 --> 00:00:54,220
I like to swim every day.

24
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,820
We have a range of classes too.

25
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,764
Do you have judo classes?

26
00:00:58,764 --> 00:01:00,320
I'm keen to learn.

27
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:03,330
Well, at the moment we offer kick-boxing.

28
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:07,200
We're planning to add judo and stretch classes soon.

29
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,070
We're currently running a range of yoga classes, too.

30
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:13,166
What about relaxing after exercise?

31
00:01:13,166 --> 00:01:16,520
I assume you have a restaurant or something.

32
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:20,330
At the moment, we've got a salad bar which is very popular.

33
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:24,140
We'll also have a fully-licensed restaurant by the end of the year.

34
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,400
Sounds good!

35
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:30,230
What kind of membership are you interested in?

36
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:32,508
Um I'm not really sure.

37
00:01:32,508 --> 00:01:34,330
What are the options?

38
00:01:34,330 --> 00:01:37,740
Well, there are three different membership schemes.

39
00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:38,664
I see.

40
00:01:38,664 --> 00:01:40,050
What's the difference?

41
00:01:40,050 --> 00:01:42,095
Well, the first one's called Gold,

42
00:01:42,095 --> 00:01:46,527
and you can use all the facilities at any time of the day

43
00:01:46,527 --> 00:01:47,209
or week.

44
00:01:47,209 --> 00:01:51,640
You can also join in as many classes as you like for free.

45
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,939
That sounds good.

46
00:01:52,939 --> 00:01:54,670
Is it very expensive?

47
00:01:54,670 --> 00:02:02,538
Well, you pay a ￡250 joining fee and then it's ￡450-oh no, I'm sorry,

48
00:02:02,538 --> 00:02:10,406
it's just gone up by ￡50, sorry about that-it's now ￡500 for the annual

49
00:02:10,406 --> 00:02:11,530
subscription fee.

50
00:02:11,530 --> 00:02:13,056
Right, got that.

51
00:02:13,056 --> 00:02:15,600
And what's the next type?

52
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:15,963
Well,

53
00:02:15,963 --> 00:02:20,684
that's Silver - it's the same as Gold except you have to pay a

54
00:02:20,684 --> 00:02:24,679
small fee of ￡1.00 per lesson for any you do

55
00:02:24,679 --> 00:02:28,310
and you can only use the centre at certain times.

56
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:29,422
I see.

57
00:02:29,422 --> 00:02:31,090
So when exactly?

58
00:02:31,090 --> 00:02:36,320
YOU can only use the facilities between 10 am and 4.30 pm.

59
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:40,690
So I couldn't use the pool at 8 in the morning or evening, then?

60
00:02:40,690 --> 00:02:42,030
That's right.

61
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:42,415
OK.

62
00:02:42,415 --> 00:02:44,338
And the price for that?

63
00:02:44,338 --> 00:02:47,800
Is the joining fee the same as for Gold?

64
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:52,172
Actually, it's slightly less than the ￡250-it's ￡225,

65
00:02:52,172 --> 00:02:55,998
but the annual fee is only ￡300.

66
00:02:55,998 --> 00:03:00,370
Does that sound more like what you want?

67
00:03:00,370 --> 00:03:03,144
Well, it's still rather more expensive than I thought.

68
00:03:03,144 --> 00:03:07,150
I'm a student here in England and I'm only here for six months.

69
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:11,200
Ah, then the Bronze scheme would probably suit you best.

70
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,620
How is that different?

71
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:16,200
Well, some of the facilities have restricted use.

72
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,910
And do I have to pay for classes?

73
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:22,400
Yes, it's ￡3 for each class you join.

74
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,105
I see.

75
00:03:23,105 --> 00:03:25,220
And what are the hours then?

76
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:31,948
Between 10.30 and 3.30 weekdays only and you pay a ￡50 joining

77
00:03:31,948 --> 00:03:32,429
fee.

78
00:03:32,429 --> 00:03:37,715
The annual fee is ￡180-it works out at ￡15 a month,

79
00:03:37,715 --> 00:03:41,560
so that would be quite a lot cheaper.

80
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:41,841
Oh,

81
00:03:41,841 --> 00:03:43,248
that should be all right.

82
00:03:43,248 --> 00:03:45,216
I could come in my free periods.

83
00:03:45,216 --> 00:03:48,310
What do I have to do if I want to join?

84
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:52,109
Well, we book you in for an assessment with an instructor,

85
00:03:52,109 --> 00:03:55,563
who will show you how to use all the equipment.

86
00:03:55,563 --> 00:04:00,398
If you want to organize a trial session and look around the centre, you'll

87
00:04:00,398 --> 00:04:02,470
need to speak to David Kynchley.

88
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:02,758
Hmm.

89
00:04:02,758 --> 00:04:04,200
Could you spell that please?

90
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:09,277
Yes, David K-Y-N-C-H-L-E-Y.

91
00:04:09,277 --> 00:04:21,123
I'll give you his direct line number.

92
00:04:21,123 --> 00:04:26,200
It's oh-four-five-eight-nine-five-three-double one.

93
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,360
Thanks.

94
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:30,800
Thank you for calling Kingswell Sports Club.
